# initialize / initialized / shutdown / exit with a minimal server.
> initialize {"rootUri": "file://${workspace}"}
< {"id": $1, "result": {"capabilities": {"positionEncoding": "utf-8", "textDocumentSync": 2}, "serverInfo": {"name": "fake", "version": "1.0"}}}
> initialized
> shutdown
< {"id": $1, "result": null}
> exit
